/ The logo chosen, carried to the next step (CustomAppsController#chosen_logo): a picture, in
/ base64, or that it's to be removed. Neither: it keeps the one it has.
- if @logo.is_a?(Hash)
  input type="hidden" name="logo_data" value=@logo[:data]
- elsif @logo == :remove
  input type="hidden" name="logo_remove" value="1"
